%% CRM lifecycle flow
%% Shows progression from lead intake through opportunity lifecycle and downstream synchronization.
flowchart LR
    Intake[Lead Intake]
    Qualify[Qualification and Scoring]
    Convert[Lead Conversion]
    Pipeline[Opportunity Stage Progression]
    Approve[Approval or Exception Handling]
    Close[Close Won or Lost]
    Sync[Export and External Synchronization]

    Intake --> Qualify --> Convert --> Pipeline --> Close --> Sync
    Pipeline --> Approve --> Pipeline
    Qualify -->|Disqualified| Intake